{"id":"sabrina-gilmar-timeless-dream","title":"Sabrina & Gilmar","subtitle":"Timeless Dream","texts":["Timeless Dream","O Gustavo Franco Fotografia nos arrancou suspiros com as fotos mágicas do ensaio digno de revista desse casal lindo. - Mariée Weddings","Surrounded by lush greenery and fantastic views of the \"Magic Island\" Florianópolis, today's featured wedding shoots by Gustavo Franco\n\n\t from Brazil takes us to an island of paradise that leave you wondering why you didn't come sooner. The photogenic pair, Sabrina and Gilmar explored the mesmeric woods and alluring beaches of this magical island, as captured these meaningful portraits tell of the couple's love story which they're sure to treasure for a lifetime. - LaBride","Lindos! Desejamos muitas felicidades aos dois. Confira agora o restante das fotos desse ensaio, que foi um dos mais mágicos e lindos que já vimos! - Mariée Weddings"],"source":"https://gusfrn.co/galerias/sabrina-gilmar-timeless-dream/","photos":[{"full":"@c/photos/aa46d9dd/28e6a329-39b5-4492-9254-7266d458c73b/32-sabrinagilmar-2048x1286.jpg","mid":"@c/photos/aa46d9dd/28e6a329-39b5-4492-9254-7266d458c73b/32-sabrinagilmar-1024x643.jpg","thumb":"@c/photos/aa46d9dd/28e6a329-39b5-4492-9254-7266d458c73b/32-sabrinagilmar-768x482.jpg","w":2048,"h":1286},{"full":"@c/photos/aa46d9dd/ddd7e198-dd53-4dfd-b567-4301e32ac7ee/1-sabrinagilmar-1365x2048.jpg","mid":"@c/photos/aa46d9dd/ddd7e198-dd53-4dfd-b567-4301e32ac7ee/1-sabrinagilmar-1279x1920.jpg","thumb":"@c/photos/aa46d9dd/ddd7e198-dd53-4dfd-b567-4301e32ac7ee/1-sabrinagilmar-682x1024.jpg","w":1365,"h":2048},{"full":"@c/photos/aa46d9dd/e20dae6f-7c1b-4655-a92b-d20e454d7d25/2-sabrinagilmar-1365x2048.jpg","mid":"@c/photos/aa46d9dd/e20dae6f-7c1b-4655-a92b-d20e454d7d25/2-sabrinagilmar-1279x1920.jpg","thumb":"@c/photos/aa46d9dd/e20dae6f-7c1b-4655-a92b-d20e454d7d25/2-sabrinagilmar-682x1024.jpg","w":1365,"h":2048},{"full":"@c/photos/aa46d9dd/e121d76c-8118-4ec8-a913-d73e432e1e06/3-sabrinagilmar-2048x1365.jpg","mi